      "end": 177,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Peket\nPeket , also p\u00e9k\u00e8t or p\u00e8ket is an eau de vie ( fruit brandy ) aromatised with juniper berries , similar to Dutch gin . The name derives from the Walloon word for juniper ."
