      "text": "Hendrick's Gin\nHendrick 's Gin is a brand of gin produced by William Grant & Sons in Girvan , Scotland , and launched in 1999 . In addition to the traditional juniper infusion , Hendrick 's uses Bulgarian rose and cucumber to add flavour . Hendrick 's gin is bottled in a dark brown apothecary-style bottle ."
